     "t": "math",
     "tex": "X_B(s) = -\\int_{\\infty}^{0} e^{(s+a)\\tau} (-d\\tau) = \\int_{\\infty}^{0} e^{(s+a)\\tau} \\, d\\tau = -\\int_{0}^{\\infty} e^{(s+a)\\tau} \\, d\\tau"
