     "text": "**Conclusion:** The algebraic expression $\\frac{1}{s+a}$ by itself represents two fundamentally different physical phenomena: one running forward in time from $t = 0$ to $+\\infty$, and another running backward in time from $-\\infty$ to $t = 0$. Specifying the ROC is not a formality; it is mathematically indispensable."
