     "text": "                       Transfer Function X(s) = N(s) / D(s)\n                                       \u2502\n            \u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510\n            \u25bc                          \u25bc                          \u25bc\n     Strictly Proper                Improper               Strictly Improper\n        (M < N)                     (M = N)                     (M > N)\n            \u2502                          \u2502                          \u2502\n            \u25bc                          \u25bc                          \u25bc\n   Direct PFE Expansion        Long Division Yields:      Long Division Yields:\n  x(t) has only modal terms      X(s) = k + R(s)/D(s)     X(s) = Poly(s) + R(s)/D(s)\n    (No impulses at t=0)               \u2502                          \u2502\n            \u2502                          \u25bc                          \u25bc\n            \u2502                 Impulse k\u00b7\u03b4(t) at origin    Multiplets: \u03b4'(t), \u03b4''(t)...\n            \u2502                          \u2502                          \u2502\n            \u25bc                          \u25bc                          \u25bc\n     Physically Realizable      Physically Realizable      Physically UNREALIZABLE\n        (Causal if ROC right)      (Causal if ROC right)      (Strictly Non-Causal)"
