     "t": "math",
     "tex": "\\mathcal{L}^{-1}\\left\\{ \\frac{A_k}{s - p_k} \\right\\} = \\begin{cases} +A_k e^{p_k t} u(t), & \\text{if ROC is to the right: } \\text{Re}(s) > \\sigma_k \\quad (\\text{Causal / Right-Sided}) \\\\ -A_k e^{p_k t} u(-t), & \\text{if ROC is to the left: } \\text{Re}(s) < \\sigma_k \\quad (\\text{Anti-Causal / Left-Sided}) \\end{cases}"
