       "tex": "X_3(s) = \\frac{1/4}{s+3} + \\frac{3/4}{s-1} \\implies x_3(t) = \\left[ \\frac{1}{4}e^{-3t} + \\frac{3}{4}e^{t} \\right] u(t)"
